cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these packings or tools, please cite them as below."
title: "Moki&Julio: 4,534 new best-known packings of equal circles in thirteen Packomania containers"
authors:
  - name: "Moki&Julio"
date-released: 2026-09-25
version: "2.1"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - equal circles
  - Packomania
  - best-known packings
  - exact certificates
abstract: >-
  4,534 packings of equal circles that improve the best-known records of Packomania's tables for the isosceles right
  triangle (crt), the circular quadrant (ccq), eight fixed rectangles (crc_100 to crc_800), the semicircle (csc), the unit
  square (csq) and the regular pentagon (cpt), each with an exact certificate verified by two independently written exact
  checkers. Results already surpassed in the literature are excluded by a prior-art gate. Also: 58 table entries proven
  optimal by Füredi's bound for thin rectangles and two proven optimal by an exact computer-assisted proof.
